<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">登录方式</p><p>在网站上选择登录。</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://chat.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-chat-web">打开</a></div>
</li><li class="app-card tone-red" data-id="app-scribe-web">
