</section><section class="apps-section apps-group" aria-labelledby="apps-group-fun" data-id="apps-group-fun">
<div class="apps-group-head"><h2 class="apps-group-title" id="apps-group-fun">娱乐应用</h2><p class="apps-group-lead">用同一个账号玩、学、娱乐。</p></div>
<ul class="apps-grid" data-id="app-list-fun"><li class="app-card tone-cyan" data-id="app-miu-web">
<div class="app-card-head">
<span class="app-card-icon"><img class="app-mark" src="/assets/img/apps/miu-mark-128.webp" width="44" height="44" alt=""></span>
