<div class="app-card-head">
<span class="app-card-icon"><img class="app-mark" src="/assets/img/apps/tuvi-mark-128.webp" width="44" height="44" alt=""></span>
<div class="app-card-heading"><h3 class="app-card-name">Tử Vi</h3>
<p class="app-card-meta"><span class="badge badge-neutral">网页应用</span><span class="mono">tuvi.hoandat.com</span></p></div>
</div>
<p class="app-card-desc">用越南语排紫微斗数命盘，并导出图片分享；仅供娱乐。</p>
<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">登录方式</p><p>在网站上选择登录，即可保存命盘。</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://tuvi.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-tuvi-web">打开</a></div>
</li><li class="app-card tone-green" data-id="app-clip-web">
<div class="app-card-head">
<span class="app-card-icon"><img class="app-mark" src="/assets/img/apps/clip-mark-128.webp" width="44" height="44" alt=""></span>
<div class="app-card-heading"><h3 class="app-card-name">Clip</h3>
<p class="app-card-meta"><span class="badge badge-neutral">网页应用</span><span class="mono">clip.hoandat.com</span></p></div>
</div>
<p class="app-card-desc">选一个模板，写几行字，加几张照片，生成竖屏短视频。</p>
<div class="app-card-how"><p class="app-card-how-label">登录方式</p><p>在网站上选择登录，即可制作视频。</p></div>
<div class="app-card-foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://clip.hoandat.com" data-id="app-open-clip-web">打开</a></div>
</li></ul>
</section>
<section class="apps-section" id="how-sign-in-works" aria-labelledby="apps-steps-title" data-id="apps-steps">
<h2 class="apps-section-title" id="apps-steps-title">登录流程</h2>
<ol class="apps-steps"><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">选择一个应用</h3><p class="apps-step-body">在它的网站上选择登录，或在终端运行 <code class="mono">tunelo login</code>。</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">使用 Google 或 GitHub 继续</h3><p class="apps-step-body">你关联的账号会为你登录。第一次登录时需选择用户名。</p></div></li><li class="apps-step"><span class="apps-step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3 class="apps-step-title">回到应用</h3><p class="apps-step-body">来自 hoandat.com 以外的应用（例如 AI 工具）会先请求你的同意。</p></div></li></ol>
</section>
<p class="apps-manage" data-id="apps-manage">如需查看或移除可以访问你账号的应用，请打开<a class="link" href="/account">账号</a>页面。</p></main>
<footer class="page-foot container"><nav class="lang-switch" aria-label="语言" data-id="lang-switch"><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=en&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="en" hreflang="en" data-id="lang-en">English</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=zh-CN&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="zh-CN" hreflang="zh-CN" aria-current="true" data-id="lang-zh-CN">中文</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=vi&amp;return=%2Fapps" lang="vi" hreflang="vi" data-id="lang-vi">Tiếng Việt</a></nav><p class="foot-links"><a class="foot-link" href="https://hoandat.com" data-id="foot-home">hoandat.com 旗下应用</a><a class="foot-link" href="/privacy" data-id="foot-privacy">隐私政策</a></p></footer>
</body>
</html>"
`;

exports[`primary tenant (hoandat.com) is unchanged > renders /privacy the same way > en 1`] = `
"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="description" content="Sign in to your account and manage the apps and devices connected to it.">
<title>Privacy policy · hoandat.com</title>
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="hoandat.com">
<meta property="og:title" content="Privacy policy · hoandat.com">
<meta property="og:description" content="Sign in to your account and manage the apps and devices connected to it.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://auth.hoandat.com/assets/img/og-image.jpg">
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://auth.hoandat.com/assets/img/og-image.jpg">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="16x16 32x32 48x48">
<link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" sizes="180x180">
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#6e56cf">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="hoandat.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter/400.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter/500.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter/600.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/400.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/600.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/700.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/tokens.css?v=HASH"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css?v=HASH">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-inner container">
<a class="idp-brand" href="/apps" data-id="idp-brand"><img class="idp-brand-mark" src="/assets/img/hoandat-mark-128.webp" width="24" height="24" alt="" aria-hidden="true"><span><b>hoandat.com</b><span class="idp-brand-suffix"> · Account</span></span> <span class="badge badge-neutral hide-sm">ISSUER_HOST</span></a>
<nav class="topbar-nav" aria-label="Site"><a class="topbar-link" href="/apps" data-id="nav-home">Home</a><a class="topbar-link" href="/account" data-id="nav-account">Account</a></nav>
</div></header>
<main class="page container auth">
<div class="card auth-card auth-card-wide">
<h1 class="auth-title">Privacy policy</h1><p class="auth-sub">Applies to the sign-in service auth.hoandat.com. Updated 24 October 2026.</p>
<div class="prose" data-id="privacy-policy">
<h2>Data we store</h2>
<ul><li>Username, email address, display name and profile picture.</li><li>The service uses no passwords. Accounts created before passwords were removed may still hold an argon2id hash of the old password and old recovery codes; they are no longer used to sign in.</li><li>When you sign in with Google, GitHub or Apple: your account ID at the provider, and the verified email, name and profile picture the provider returns. With Apple, the email may be a private relay address you chose to share, and a token is kept only to revoke the link at Apple when you remove it.</li><li>When you link Telegram: the chat ID and Telegram username.</li><li>Sign-in sessions, devices and apps you allowed, with when they were used.</li><li>Which app you signed in to and when (the app&#39;s ID, the time, and whether you signed in on these pages or with an existing session), without IP address or browser; kept for 400 days.</li><li>A security log (sign-ins, linking or removing sign-in methods, revoked sessions and access) with IP address and browser; the IP address and browser of events not yet delivered are deleted after 30 days.</li></ul>
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>Data is used only to authenticate you, keep you signed in, recover your account, detect unusual access and count, in aggregate, how many people use each app. The service sends no email, shows no ads, and never sells or shares your data or these statistics.</p>
<p data-id="privacy-analytics">The pages use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits in aggregate; it sets no cookies.</p>
<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>Profile information goes only to apps run by the same owner (the hoandat.com apps) or to apps you allowed, within what you allowed. It is not shared with anyone else.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>On your <a href="/account">Account</a> page you can see and edit your profile, unlink Google, GitHub, Apple or Telegram, and sign out sessions and apps you allowed.</p>
<p data-id="privacy-delete">You can delete your account yourself on the <a href="/account">Account</a> page (Delete account). It is deleted right away: sessions, devices, links, app sign-in history and your profile are removed, and the security log keeps only the event type, its time and the account ID.</p>
<p>If deleting does not work, contact quocdat254@gmail.com.</p>
<h2>Storage</h2>
<p>Data is stored on servers in Vietnam managed by the service owner, with daily backups kept for 14 days.</p>
<h2>YouTube API Services</h2>
<p data-id="privacy-youtube">The owner of this service publishes videos about its apps to its own YouTube channels with a tool that uses YouTube API Services. The tool acts only on those channels: it does not read, store or share the YouTube data of people who use this service. Use of YouTube API Services is subject to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" rel="noopener">YouTube Terms of Service</a>, and Google handles data under the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>. Access granted to the tool can be revoked in <a href="https://security.google.com/settings/security/permissions" rel="noopener">your Google account&#39;s security settings</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="page-foot container"><nav class="lang-switch" aria-label="Language" data-id="lang-switch"><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=en&amp;return=%2Fprivacy" lang="en" hreflang="en" aria-current="true" data-id="lang-en">English</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=zh-CN&amp;return=%2Fprivacy" lang="zh-CN" hreflang="zh-CN" data-id="lang-zh-CN">中文</a><a class="lang-option" href="/lang?set=vi&amp;return=%2Fprivacy" lang="vi" hreflang="vi" data-id="lang-vi">Tiếng Việt</a></nav><p class="foot-links"><a class="foot-link" href="https://hoandat.com" data-id="foot-home">An app from hoandat.com</a><a class="foot-link" href="/privacy" data-id="foot-privacy">Privacy policy</a></p></footer>
</body>
</html>"
`;

